  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidating  the Ethiopian Human Rights Commission</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As in the previous phase (2020-2024) of this pooled funding mechanism, the  overall  objective in this phase  is to enable  the Ethiopian Human Rights Commission to  fulfil its mandate to promote and protect human rights in conjunction with state and non-state actors as well as with regional and international bodies. Emphasis will be on safeguarding the council&#x2019;s independence and ability to influence the human rights agenda in Ethiopia, with  more resources directed towards operational human rights activities and engagement with key stakeholders and policy makers.</narrative>
  </description>
